{"id": 306, "forum": "28-kupeli", "title": "Купель на Валдае. 2020", "posts": [{"id": 2111, "author": "Редактор", "date": "2020-12-23", "html": "<p>Мы проводим строительство купели на Валдае. Гидроизоляция организована с помощью EPDM-мембраны.<br>Вместо отливки стен купели взяли два бетонных кольца.<br>Стены будут обшиты лиственницей.</p>", "photos": [{"src": "/forum/files/57_289985c0336067ad6805af0f0a604042", "thumb": "", "name": "valdkup2020.001.jpeg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_09c709d507c9f928a30633ac8c0fd65e", "thumb": "", "name": "valdkup2020.002.jpeg"}]}, {"id": 2112, "author": "Редактор", "date": "2020-12-23", "html": "<p>Произведена экскавация грунта. Выровнен котлован. Уложена гидроизоляция</p>", "photos": [{"src": "/forum/files/57_6e0e86d8dc82b4e0e06587849aa5d65e", "thumb": "", "name": "valdkup2020.003.jpeg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_4ccfe592483146de988c5a53ac9e637f", "thumb": "", "name": "valdkup2020.004.jpeg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_1316521b6457d4ff51bd744d6869ad1f", "thumb": "", "name": "valdkup2020.005.jpeg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_9a18f7466b72f14f3eae888ead925d7f", "thumb": "", "name": "valdkup2020.007.jpeg"}]}, {"id": 2113, "author": "Редактор", "date": "2020-12-23", "html": "<p>Установлены бетонные кольца. Стенки обшиты лиственницей</p>", "photos": [{"src": "/forum/files/57_cdfa2bdf90121d96b2d5b12fcbd33f17", "thumb": "", "name": "valdkup2020.006.jpeg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_aab4776d775ea73918f165bdf3b0bc5e", "thumb": "", "name": "valdkup2020.008.jpeg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_5d633a10e6647a56a28f1b6684a88956", "thumb": "", "name": "valdkup2020.009.jpeg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_2e76dd2a6429ee02be8cf82ead20531c", "thumb": "", "name": "valdkup2020.012.jpeg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_02095df75275f65d736d92b3f5d030fa", "thumb": "", "name": "valdkup2020.010.jpeg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_2d22e6addceb3b2d0690ca92a83e795f", "thumb": "", "name": "valdkup2020.011.jpeg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_5222d375df6a3c13761618f9dbf8a85f", "thumb": "", "name": "valdkup2020.013.jpeg"}]}, {"id": 2114, "author": "Редактор", "date": "2020-12-23", "html": "<p>Ход строительства:</p><p><a href=\"/netcat_files/userfiles/video/valdkup2020.video01.mp4\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">https&#58;//gidrologia&#46;ru/netcat_files/userfiles/video/valdkup2020&#46;video01&#46;mp4</a><br><a href=\"/netcat_files/userfiles/video/valdkup2020.video02.mp4\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">https&#58;//gidrologia&#46;ru/netcat_files/userfiles/video/valdkup2020&#46;video02&#46;mp4</a></p>", "photos": []}, {"id": 2115, "author": "Редактор", "date": "2020-12-29", "html": "<p>Первый запуск купели<br><a href=\"/netcat_files/userfiles/video/valdkup2020.video03.mp4\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">https&#58;//gidrologia&#46;ru/netcat_files/userfiles/video/valdkup2020&#46;video03&#46;mp4</a></p>", "photos": []}, {"id": 2116, "author": "Редактор", "date": "2020-12-29", "html": "<p>Строительство купели завершено</p><p><a href=\"/netcat_files/userfiles/video/valdkup2020.video04.mp4\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">https&#58;//gidrologia&#46;ru/netcat_files/userfiles/video/valdkup2020&#46;video04&#46;mp4</a><br><a href=\"/netcat_files/userfiles/video/valdkup2020.video05.mp4\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">https&#58;//gidrologia&#46;ru/netcat_files/userfiles/video/valdkup2020&#46;video05&#46;mp4</a></p>", "photos": [{"src": "/forum/files/57_7022deaf2c3d6b8f53e5f7b4f965dfa0", "thumb": "", "name": "valdkup2020.014.jpeg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_9c70e59c1d26827eccd6eb5646654856", "thumb": "", "name": "valdkup2020.015.jpeg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_94c7a4444fb1b20c85688b54012f4f24", "thumb": "", "name": "valdkup2020.016.jpeg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_66f370a5f621e506d9fef507f9bf7f5a", "thumb": "", "name": "valdkup2020.017.jpeg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_26e50ae737153cbcdda09494130759a8", "thumb": "", "name": "valdkup2020.018.jpeg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_81fe0bca3fd6b02fc0f27932